./ R 00806000          $ 00806100 100                                           
*  SYSIPLDV IS CP'S OWN FIELD FOR THIS AND ALWAYS WAS -- SEE   XA0011DK         
*  DMKCPI 00484000. WRITING IT HERE REPLACES A COPY INTO THE   XA0011DK         
*  ARCHITECTED I/O INTERRUPTION CODE, WHICH ON ESA/390 IS THE  XA0011DK         
*  SUBSYSTEM ID WORD AND MUST NOT HOLD A DEVICE ADDRESS. NO    XA0011DK         
*  SEMANTIC CHANGE. I-47.                                      XA0011DK         
         STH   R13,SYSIPLDV   SET IPL DEVICE ADDRESS           XA0011DK         
